                            <comment id="494622" author="gerrit" created="Sat, 16 May 2026 15:38:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Oleg Drokin &amp;lt;green@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&quot; merged in patch &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65112/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65112/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subject: &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19901&quot; title=&quot;allow &apos;lctl nodemap modify rbac=[+-]role&apos;&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19901&quot;&gt;LU-19901&lt;/a&gt; nodemap: support incremental RBAC role updates&lt;br/&gt;
